{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":52033,"duration_api_ms":51972,"num_turns":8,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"00c30424-c8bf-491e-a691-1777cceda9ed","total_cost_usd":0.31427974999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27485,"cache_read_input_tokens":184627,"output_tokens":2006,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27485,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":7,"outputTokens":2006,"cacheReadInputTokens":184627,"cacheCreationInputTokens":27485,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.31427974999999997,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"summary":"Both amendments identify real, verified bugs. Amendment fr-2-5f3aaec6: the ALL array now has TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings at index 3, shifting AddShrimp to index 6, so 5 advances lands on CleanFilter (which accepts floats), making the integer-rejection test silently pass or test the wrong action. Amendment fr-2-d613a3c7: git history confirms old TrimPlants routed trimmed biomass to fine_detritus (kept in tank), identical to TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings; the migration incorrectly maps it to TrimPlantsAndRemove which exports biomass out of the system, silently changing gameplay for migrated saves.","votes":[{"amendment_id":"fr-2-5f3aaec6","decision":"accept","rationale":"Verified: ActionKind::ALL now has 13 entries with TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings inserted at index 3. Five calls to select_next_action() lands on CleanFilter (index 5), not AddShrimp (index 6). CleanFilter accepts a float intensity field, so \"1.5\" parses successfully and submit() returns Ok instead of Err, meaning the test either panics on expect_err or (worse) silently tests the wrong thing. The fix — either incrementing the loop count to 6 or navigating by ActionKind match — is straightforward and correct."},{"amendment_id":"fr-2-d613a3c7","decision":"accept","rationale":"Git history definitively confirms the original TrimPlants added trimmed biomass to fine_detritus_g_total (kept biomass in-tank), which is semantically identical to the new TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings variant. The migration maps TrimPlants → TrimPlantsAndRemove, which exports biomass out of the system entirely — the opposite of the original behavior. This is a real save-compatibility bug that silently changes gameplay for any migrated save with queued trim actions. The correct mapping should be TrimPlants → TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings, or at minimum the intentional semantic change must be documented."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"b3ab0581-1462-4da4-abcd-a02eecb316a9"}
